{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #170", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>A retailer sells clothes at some profit on the cost price but uses a false measuring tape of 80 cm instead of 1 metre. If his overall profit percentage is 45%, then find the profit percentage on the cost price.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2326;&#2369;&#2342;&#2352;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; 1 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 80 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2347;&#2368;&#2340;&#2366; &#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2375;&#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; 45% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["12%", "18%", "25%", "16%"], "options_hi": ["12%", "18%", "25%", "16%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let cost price of 1 meter of cloth = &#8377;100</p><p>Cost price of 80 cm cloth = &#8377;80</p><p>Overall profit percentage = 45%</p><p>Selling price of cloth = 145% of 80 = &#8377;116</p><p>Profit percentage = [(116  -  100)/100] *100 = 16%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let cost price of 1 meter of cloth = &#8377;100</p><p>Cost price of 80 cm cloth = &#8377;80</p><p>Overall profit percentage = 45%</p><p>Selling price of cloth = 145% of 80 = &#8377;116</p><p>Profit percentage = [(116  -  100)/100] *100 = 16%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest milkman purchases milk at &#8377;48 per litre and mixes it by adding 4 litres of water. He then sells the mixture at &#8377;54 per litre, earning a profit of 20%. Find the initial quantity of pure milk he purchased.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2370;&#2343;&#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; 48 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2370;&#2343; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 4 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2357;&#2361; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; 54 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 20% &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2375; &#2327;&#2319; &#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2342;&#2370;&#2343; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2352;&#2306;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["50 litres", "60 litres", "55 litres", "45 litres"], "options_hi": ["50 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "60 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "55 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "45 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Cost price of milk per litre = &#8377;48</p><p>Cost price of mixture per litre = 54*100/120 = &#8377;45</p><p>Using allegation method  -  </p><p><img width=241 height=118 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image001.png\"></p><p>Ratio of milk to water = 45:3 = 15:1</p><p>Initial quantity of milk = 15*4 = 60 litres</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Cost price of milk per litre = &#8377;48</p><p>Cost price of mixture per litre = 54*100/120 = &#8377;45</p><p>Using allegation method  -  </p><p><img width=241 height=118 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image001.png\"></p><p>Ratio of milk to water = 45:3 = 15:1</p><p>Initial quantity of milk = 15*4 = 60 litres</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest seller cheats while buying and selling a television. He makes a profit of 8% when he bought the television and 12% when he sold the television. Find his actual profit percentage. (rounded off to one decimal)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2335;&#2375;&#2354;&#2368;&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2344; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2343;&#2379;&#2326;&#2366;&#2343;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2348; &#2357;&#2361; &#2335;&#2375;&#2354;&#2368;&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2344; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 8% &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2332;&#2348; &#2357;&#2361; &#2335;&#2375;&#2354;&#2368;&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2344; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 12% &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; (&#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;)</p>", "options_en": ["28.8%", "21.7%", "30.4%", "27.5%"], "options_hi": ["28.8%", "21.7%", "30.4%", "27.5%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let the actual price of television = &#8377;100</p><p>Cost price of television = 100*92/100 = &#8377;92</p><p>Selling price of television = 100*112/100 = &#8377;112</p><p>Profit percentage = [(112-92)/92]*100 = 21.7%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the actual price of television = &#8377;100</p><p>Cost price of television = 100*92/100 = &#8377;92</p><p>Selling price of television = 100*112/100 = &#8377;112</p><p>Profit percentage = [(112-92)/92]*100 = 21.7%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A man bought some dry fruits at &#8377;840/kg and sells them &#8377;900/kg. If he uses false weight of 750 g instead of 1 kg, then find his actual profit percent.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2310;&#2342;&#2350;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2360;&#2370;&#2326;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2357;&#2375; 840 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306; 900 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 750 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2375;&#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["42.85%", "36.72%", "40.59%", "39.32%"], "options_hi": ["42.85%", "36.72%", "40.59%", "39.32%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Cost price of 750 g dry fruits = 840 * 750/1000 = &#8377;630</p><p>Selling price of 1 kg dry fruits = &#8377;900</p><p>Actual profit = [(900 - 630)/630] * 100 = 42.85%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Cost price of 750 g dry fruits = 840 * 750/1000 = &#8377;630</p><p>Selling price of 1 kg dry fruits = &#8377;900</p><p>Actual profit = [(900 - 630)/630] * 100 = 42.85%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A shopkeeper sells some quantity of oats at the cost price, but he uses false weight of 'X' gm instead of 1000 gm and gain 5% profit. Find the quantity of oats he gives instead of 1000 g. (rounded off to two decimals)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2323;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2357;&#2361; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 'X' &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2375;&#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 5% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2323;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2351;&#2361; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; (&#2342;&#2379; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;)</p>", "options_en": ["962.86 gm", "978.17 gm", "943.45 gm", "952.38 gm"], "options_hi": ["962.86 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "978.17 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "943.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "952.38 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Quantity of oats given instead of 1000 gm = X gm</p><p>Profit percentage = 5%</p><p>X = [1000/(100 + 5)] * 100</p><p>X = 952.38 gm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Quantity of oats given instead of 1000 gm = X gm</p><p>Profit percentage = 5%</p><p>X = [1000/(100 + 5)] * 100</p><p>X = 952.38 gm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A seller earns a profit of 25% after selling 60 kg of rice. He adds some impurities in the rice and sells it at the cost price. Find the weight of impurities in 60 kg of rice.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; 60 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2325;&#2352; 25% &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2309;&#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 60 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["14 kg", "15 kg", "12 kg", "10 kg"], "options_hi": ["14 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;", "15 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;", "12 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;", "10 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let cost price of 1 kg of rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Selling price of 60 kg of rice = &#8377;6000</p><p>Cost price of 60 kg of rice = &#8377;6000 *(100/125) = &#8377;4800</p><p>Total weight of rice = 4800/100 = 48 kg</p><p>Hence, the weight of impurities in 60 kg of rice = 60  -  48 = 12 kg</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let cost price of 1 kg of rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Selling price of 60 kg of rice = &#8377;6000</p><p>Cost price of 60 kg of rice = &#8377;6000 *(100/125) = &#8377;4800</p><p>Total weight of rice = 4800/100 = 48 kg</p><p>Hence, the weight of impurities in 60 kg of rice = 60  -  48 = 12 kg</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest dealer says that he sells his goods at cost price but uses a false weight and thus gains 21%. For 1 kg, he uses a false weight of  -  </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2361;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; 21% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2357;&#2361; - &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["866.44 gm", "775.12 gm", "826.45 gm", "784.56 gm"], "options_hi": ["866.44 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "775.12 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "826.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "784.56 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Selling price of 1000 grams of goods = &#8377;1000</p><p>Profit percentage = 21%</p><p>Cost price of the falsely measured goods = 1000*100/121 = &#8377;826.45</p><p>&#8377;1000 &rarr; 1000 gm</p><p>&#8377;826.45 &rarr; 826.45 gm</p><p>So, he uses false weight of 826.45 gm.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Selling price of 1000 grams of goods = &#8377;1000</p><p>Profit percentage = 21%</p><p>Cost price of the falsely measured goods = 1000*100/121 = &#8377;826.45</p><p>&#8377;1000 &rarr; 1000 gm</p><p>&#8377;826.45 &rarr; 826.45 gm</p><p>So, he uses false weight of 826.45 gm.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A man pays &#8377;75 per litre for almond milk. He adds some water and sells the mixture at &#8377;80 per litres and makes a profit of 28%. Find the ratio of final quantity of almond milk and water respectively. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2310;&#2342;&#2350;&#2368; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2370;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 75 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2311;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2341;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; 80 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 28% &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2370;&#2343; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["6:1", "5:1", "7:1", "4:1"], "options_hi": ["6:1", "5:1", "7:1", "4:1"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Cost price of almond milk per litre = &#8377;75</p><p>Cost price of mixture per litre = 80*100/128 = &#8377;62.5</p><p>Using allegation method  -  </p><p><img width=255 height=105 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image002.png\"> </p><p>Ratio of almond milk to water = 62.5 : 12.5 = 5:1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Cost price of almond milk per litre = &#8377;75</p><p>Cost price of mixture per litre = 80*100/128 = &#8377;62.5</p><p>Using allegation method  -  </p><p><img width=255 height=105 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image002.png\"> </p><p>Ratio of almond milk to water = 62.5 : 12.5 = 5:1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A shopkeeper increases the marked price of rice by 25% above the cost price and offers a certain discount to customers. He uses a false weight, giving 900 gm instead of 1 kg. If his total profit percentage is 33.33%, then find the discount percentage he provides on the marked price.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2375; 25% &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 900 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; 33.33% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["4%", "7%", "2.5%", "3%"], "options_hi": ["4%", "7%", "2.5%", "3%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let cost price of 1000 gm of rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Marked price of rice = 125% of 100 = &#8377;125</p><p>Cost price of 900 gm = &#8377;90</p><p>Profit percentage = 33.33% = 1/3</p><p>Selling price of rice = (1 + 1/3)*90 = &#8377;120</p><p>Discount = 100  -  (120/125)*100 = 4%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let cost price of 1000 gm of rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Marked price of rice = 125% of 100 = &#8377;125</p><p>Cost price of 900 gm = &#8377;90</p><p>Profit percentage = 33.33% = 1/3</p><p>Selling price of rice = (1 + 1/3)*90 = &#8377;120</p><p>Discount = 100  -  (120/125)*100 = 4%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A seller sells goods at 15% profit and uses weight 14% less than the actual measure. Find his profit percentage.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; 15% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2352; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; 14% &#2325;&#2350; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["33.72%", "29.87%", "31.45%", "34.25%"], "options_hi": ["33.72%", "29.87%", "31.45%", "34.25%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let cost price of 1 kg of goods = &#8377;100</p><p>He uses 14% less weight i.e. he sells 860 gm instead of 1000 gm</p><p>Cost price of 860 gm of goods = &#8377;86</p><p>Selling price of 1 kg of goods = 115% of 100 = &#8377;115</p><p>Profit percentage = [(115  -  86)/86]*100 = 33.72%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let cost price of 1 kg of goods = &#8377;100</p><p>He uses 14% less weight i.e. he sells 860 gm instead of 1000 gm</p><p>Cost price of 860 gm of goods = &#8377;86</p><p>Selling price of 1 kg of goods = 115% of 100 = &#8377;115</p><p>Profit percentage = [(115  -  86)/86]*100 = 33.72%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Trisha sells a drink at its cost price but gains 20% profit by using a false weight. Find the actual quantity of the drink she sells when she claims to sell 4.8 litres. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2358;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; &#2325;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2325;&#2375; 20% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2375; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; 4.8 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["4.2 litres", "3.8 litres", "4 litres", "3 litres"], "options_hi": ["4.2 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "3.8 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "4 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;", "3 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Quantity of drink = 4.8 *1000 = 4800 ml</p><p>Let the error = X ml</p><p>Profit percentage = 20%</p><p>[X/(4800  -  X)]*100 = 20</p><p>5X = 4800  -  X</p><p>X = 800 ml</p><p>Quantity of drink Trisha gives in 4.8 litres = 4800  -  800 = 4000 ml = 4 litres</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Quantity of drink = 4.8 *1000 = 4800 ml</p><p>Let the error = X ml</p><p>Profit percentage = 20%</p><p>[X/(4800  -  X)]*100 = 20</p><p>5X = 4800  -  X</p><p>X = 800 ml</p><p>Quantity of drink Trisha gives in 4.8 litres = 4800  -  800 = 4000 ml = 4 litres</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest merchant incurs a 17.5% loss on the cost price while selling rice. However, by using a false weight instead of the standard 1000 grams, he secures an overall profit of 10%. Find the actual weight used by the seller.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; 17.5% &#2325;&#2368; &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2325; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2325;&#2375;, &#2357;&#2361; 10% &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["840 gm", "750 gm", "900 gm", "800 gm"], "options_hi": ["840 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "750 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "900 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "800 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let the cost price of 1000 gm rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Selling price of 1000 gm rice = (100  -  17.5)% of 100 = &#8377;82.5</p><p>Cost price of actual weight = 82.5*100/110 = &#8377;75</p><p>Actual weight used by the seller = 75*(1000/100) = 750 gm</p><p><b>Express method:</b></p><p><img width=88 height=76 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image003.png\"></p><p>Profit = 10%</p><p>X = 825*100/110</p><p>X = 750 gm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the cost price of 1000 gm rice = &#8377;100</p><p>Selling price of 1000 gm rice = (100  -  17.5)% of 100 = &#8377;82.5</p><p>Cost price of actual weight = 82.5*100/110 = &#8377;75</p><p>Actual weight used by the seller = 75*(1000/100) = 750 gm</p><p><b>Express method:</b></p><p><img width=88 height=76 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image003.png\"></p><p>Profit = 10%</p><p>X = 825*100/110</p><p>X = 750 gm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A trader sells sugar at its cost price but cheats by weighing X% more while buying and 10% less while selling. If his overall profit was 20%, then find the value of X.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2330;&#2368;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; X% &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; 10% &#2325;&#2350; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354;&#2325;&#2352; &#2343;&#2379;&#2326;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; 20% &#2341;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["10%", "17%", "8%", "12%"], "options_hi": ["10%", "17%", "8%", "12%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=316 height=76 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image004.png\"></p><p>Profit percentage = 20</p><p>[(100 + X  -  90)/90]*100 = 20</p><p>10 + X = 18</p><p>X = 8%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=316 height=76 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image004.png\"></p><p>Profit percentage = 20</p><p>[(100 + X  -  90)/90]*100 = 20</p><p>10 + X = 18</p><p>X = 8%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A vegetable vendor marks the price of carrots 30% above the cost price and offers an 18% discount to the customer. While purchasing, he measures 260 grams extra per kilogram, whereas during sales, he provides only 960 grams instead of 1 kg. Find his overall profit percentage. (rounded off to one decimal)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2348;&#2381;&#2332;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2327;&#2366;&#2332;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2375; 30% &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; 18% &#2325;&#2368; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; 260 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2309;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2348;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2380;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344;, &#2357;&#2361; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 960 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; (&#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;)</p>", "options_en": ["39.9%", "32.4%", "43.6%", "37.8%"], "options_hi": ["39.9%", "32.4%", "43.6%", "37.8%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let cost price of carrots = &#8377;100</p><p>Marked price of carrots = 130% of 100 = &#8377;130</p><p>Discount = 18%</p><p>Selling price of carrots = (100  -  18)% of 130 = &#8377;106.6</p><p>Profit percentage = 6.6%</p><p>Now, He takes 1260 gm instead of 1000 gm and gives 960 gm instead of 1000 gm.</p><p>Profit = 1260  -  960 = 300</p><p>New cost price = &#8377;960 </p><p>Profit % = (300/960)*100 = 31.25%</p><p>Overall profit percentage = 6.6 + 31.25 + (6.6*31.25)/100 = 39.9%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let cost price of carrots = &#8377;100</p><p>Marked price of carrots = 130% of 100 = &#8377;130</p><p>Discount = 18%</p><p>Selling price of carrots = (100  -  18)% of 130 = &#8377;106.6</p><p>Profit percentage = 6.6%</p><p>Now, He takes 1260 gm instead of 1000 gm and gives 960 gm instead of 1000 gm.</p><p>Profit = 1260  -  960 = 300</p><p>New cost price = &#8377;960 </p><p>Profit % = (300/960)*100 = 31.25%</p><p>Overall profit percentage = 6.6 + 31.25 + (6.6*31.25)/100 = 39.9%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A vendor marks the price of tea 40% above the cost price and gives a 12% discount. He also uses a faulty scale, giving only 850 gm instead of 1 kg. Find his total percentage profit.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2375; 40% &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 12% &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2379;&#2359;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2368; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2379; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&