;&#2350;&#2351; 12% &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; 17% &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2379;&#2326;&#2366;&#2343;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["32.67%", "34.93%", "31.33%", "35.58%"], "options_hi": ["32.67%", "34.93%", "31.33%", "35.58%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=317 height=75 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image005.png\"></p><p>Profit% = [(112  -  83)/83]*100 = 34.93%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=317 height=75 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27562/image005.png\"></p><p>Profit% = [(112  -  83)/83]*100 = 34.93%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest shopkeeper sold wheat at &#8377;60/kg, but he gives only 960 gm of the wheat instead of 1 kg while selling. If the actual percentage profit earned by the shopkeeper is 25%, then find the cost price of wheat per kg.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2375; 60 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2375;&#2361;&#2370;&#2306; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2366;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 960 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2327;&#2375;&#2361;&#2370;&#2306; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&